    "Cada uno está conectado por separado: quitar uno no toca a los demás. No se deshace: tendría que escanear el código otra vez.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "device": {
              "ipad": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Each one is connected on its own: removing one doesn't touch the others. It can't be undone: it would have to scan the code again."
                }
              },
