            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With this, %@ has 1 version."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con la app abierta baja a toda velocidad; con la app cerrada iOS la frena mucho. Para bajar rápido, deja Orbital abierta: al salir, sigue sola, más lento.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With the app open it downloads at full speed; with the app closed iOS slows it down a lot. To download fast, keep Orbital open: when you leave, it keeps going on its own, slower."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con la app abierta lo sabes al momento. Con la app cerrada, iOS decide cuándo revisar: el aviso puede tardar un rato.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With the app open you know right away. With the app closed, iOS decides when to check: the notification may take a while."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con la misma fecha": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With the same date"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con premios cuentan el formato, la época y lo que ya viste.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With awards, only format, era and what you've watched apply."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con subtítulos para este video": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With subtitles for this video"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con tu Orbital conectada, «Ver en la TV» pone en la consola lo que ves aquí, donde ibas. Trakt se conecta aparte en cada uno.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With your Orbital connected, “Watch on TV” plays on the console what you're watching here, where you left off. Trakt is connected separately on each."
