    },
    "Real-Debrid en real-debrid.com, TorBox en torbox.app y AllDebrid en alldebrid.com. Orbital no cobra nada.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Real-Debrid at real-debrid.com, TorBox at torbox.app and AllDebrid at alldebrid.com. Orbital doesn't charge anything."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Real-Debrid es la nube": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Real-Debrid is the cloud"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Real-Debrid es un servicio de pago que guarda películas y series en internet. Orbital no las tiene: las busca ahí por ti.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Real-Debrid is a paid service that keeps movies and shows online. Orbital doesn't have them: it finds them there for you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Real-Debrid guarda el video; Orbital lo encuentra.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Real-Debrid keeps the video; Orbital finds it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Real-Debrid las sirve": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Real-Debrid serves them"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Real-Debrid limita cada conexión: con varias a la vez baja mucho más rápido, y así baja Orbital con la app abierta.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Real-Debrid limits each connection: with several at once it downloads much faster, and that's how Orbital downloads with the app open."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Real-Debrid no contesta": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Real-Debrid isn't responding"
          }
        }
      }
    },
