      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If the cloud doesn't have it yet, it requests it 3 min before the end of the one you're watching."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Si las descargas van lentas: mide tu internet, Real-Debrid y la forma en que baja la app.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If downloads are slow: measures your internet, Real-Debrid and how the app downloads."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Si lo pediste en la TV con tu misma cuenta, este iPhone te avisa cuando lo note: al abrir la app o cuando iOS lo deja revisar, a veces minutos o una hora después.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "device": {
              "ipad": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "If you requested it on the TV with the same account, this iPad lets you know once it notices: when you open the app, or when iOS lets it check, sometimes minutes or an hour later."
                }
              },
              "iphone": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
