            "value": "If it doesn't hear you"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Si quieres ir rápido: desliza a la derecha para guardarla, a la izquierda para pasar y hacia arriba si es para hoy.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If you want to go fast: swipe right to save it, left to pass and up if it's for today."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Si quieres otra, toca la bandera, a la derecha de «Ver».": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "device": {
              "ipad": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "If you want another one, tap the flag to the right of “Watch”."
                }
              },
              "iphone": {
