    "Torrentio busca las versiones de lo que quieres ver. Aquí decides cuáles te enseña. Lo de abajo ya viene bien; cámbialo solo si algo te molesta.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Torrentio finds the versions of what you want to watch. Here you decide which ones it shows you. The settings below are already fine; change them only if something bothers you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
